open an issue.

What was changed
----------------

`scripts/vendor-collection.mjs` is the complete record of the modifications, and
re-running it reproduces them. In summary: agent `name` fields were rewritten to
each file's own stem so they are valid identifiers; frontmatter that does not parse
as YAML was re-emitted using block scalars; five agents that shipped without
frontmatter were given some; and skill directory names were lowercased. Prose,
instructions and colours are unmodified.
